      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "The claimed direct module check for P_5 is incomplete. Its listed pair representatives omit {2,3} (and its reversal {3,4}); its listed three-vertex representatives omit {1,3,4}, {2,3,5}, and {2,3,4}. Neither [L2] nor [F1] checks those subsets, so the listed cases do not establish the assertion that P_5 has no nontrivial module. Each omitted case is easily split by an outside path vertex.",
